// 1-17: switching lenses in mid-air. Zig-zag down: a run down-right, then a run down-left.
id l1-17
name 1-17 SPECTRUM
tagline every colour, none of them for long.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main blue green red
mechanics current:2 blue:2 green:2 red:2
new -
portion 4.5 blue zone ledges
portion 5 green zone ledges
portion 5.2 switch colours mid-climb
hardness 4.9
