text THE COLOUR CHANGES STONE TO STONE.\nCROSS INTO THE NEXT ZONE AND ITS STONES APPEAR.\nTHE ONES BEHIND YOU FADE. KEEP MOVING. || NOW SWITCH IN THE AIR. JUMP, LET GO OF {recal},\nPRESS IT AGAIN AS YOU CROSS INTO THE NEXT COLOUR.\nLET GO WHILE STANDING ON A COLOUR AND YOU FALL THROUGH IT.
